  ("For example, one fundamental concept is that of determining the similarity of two" 0.14287 0.85715 0.69274 0.71415 0.71415 0.02141 0.00473 0.3139 0.0290 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" 0.0159 nil nil 0 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" nil)
  ("entities described by data. This ability forms the basis for various specific tasks. It may" 0.14286 0.85721 0.71178 0.7332 0.7332 0.02141 0.00473 0.3306 0.0602 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" 0.0159 nil nil 0 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" nil)
  ("be used directly to find customers similar to a given customer. It forms the core of several" 0.14286 0.85715 0.73083 0.75224 0.75086 0.02141 0.00473 0.4207 0.0194 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" 0.0159 nil nil 0 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" nil)
