  ("Preface" 0.19625 0.24019 0.92248 0.93878 0.93878 0.0163 nil 0.1905 0.0440 "ELLVYP+MyriadPro-SemiboldCond" 0.0136 t nil 0 "ELLVYP+MyriadPro-SemiboldCond" t))
  (19
  ("1. Of course, each author has the distinct impression that he did the majority of the work on the book." 0.1594 0.80971 0.87068 0.88699 0.88699 0.01631 0.0036 0.3396 0.0112 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" 0.0121 nil nil 1 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" nil)
  ("buried in algorithm details or mathematical propositions. In this book we instead focus" 0.14285 0.85714 0.07906 0.10047 0.10047 0.02141 0.00473 0.3785 0.0548 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" 0.0159 nil nil 0 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" nil)
  ("on the unifying concepts, presenting specific tasks and algorithms as natural manifes‐" 0.14285 0.85713 0.09811 0.11952 0.11952 0.02141 0.00473 0.3148 0.0220 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" 0.0159 nil nil 0 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" nil)
  ("tations of them." 0.14286 0.27397 0.11716 0.13857 0.13857 0.02141 0.00473 0.3812 0.0567 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" 0.0159 nil nil 0 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" nil)
  ("As another example, in evaluating the utility of a pattern, we see a notion of lift— how" 0.14286 0.85724 0.14527 0.16669 0.16531 0.02141 0.00473 0.3733 0.0220 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" 0.0159 nil nil 0 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" nil)
  ("much more prevalent a pattern is than would be expected by chance—recurring broadly" 0.14286 0.85715 0.16432 0.18573 0.18573 0.02141 0.00473 0.3748 0.0477 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" 0.0159 nil nil 0 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" nil)
  ("across data science. It is used to evaluate very different sorts of patterns in different" 0.14286 0.85714 0.18337 0.20478 0.20478 0.02141 0.00473 0.2241 0.0516 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" 0.0159 nil nil 0 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" nil)
  ("contexts. Algorithms for targeting advertisements are evaluated by computing the lift" 0.14285 0.85714 0.20242 0.22383 0.22383 0.02141 0.00473 0.3193 0.0742 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" 0.0159 nil nil 0 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" nil)
  ("one gets for the targeted population. Lift is used to judge the weight of evidence for or" 0.14287 0.85715 0.22146 0.24288 0.24288 0.02141 0.00473 0.3053 0.0309 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" 0.0159 nil nil 0 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" nil)
  ("against a conclusion. Lift helps determine whether a co-occurrence (an association) in" 0.14286 0.85715 0.24051 0.26193 0.26193 0.02141 0.00473 0.3078 0.0590 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" 0.0159 nil nil 0 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" nil)
  ("data is interesting, as opposed to simply being a natural consequence of popularity." 0.14285 0.8311 0.25956 0.28097 0.28097 0.02141 0.00473 0.3041 0.0352 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" 0.0159 nil nil 0 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" nil)
  ("We believe that explaining data science around such fundamental concepts not only" 0.14285 0.85714 0.28768 0.30909 0.30909 0.02141 0.00473 0.2817 0.0271 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" 0.0159 nil nil 0 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" nil)
  ("aids the reader, it also facilitates communication between business stakeholders and" 0.14285 0.85713 0.30673 0.32814 0.32814 0.02141 0.00473 0.2851 0.0334 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" 0.0159 nil nil 0 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" nil)
  ("data scientists. It provides a shared vocabulary and enables both parties to understand" 0.14286 0.85734 0.32577 0.34719 0.34719 0.02141 0.00473 0.2734 0.0352 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" 0.0159 nil nil 0 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" nil)
  ("each other better. The shared concepts lead to deeper discussions that may uncover" 0.14286 0.85715 0.34482 0.36623 0.36623 0.02141 0.00473 0.2406 0.0379 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" 0.0159 nil nil 0 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" nil)
  ("critical issues otherwise missed." 0.14286 0.40696 0.36387 0.38528 0.38528 0.02141 0.00473 0.3356 0.0573 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" 0.0159 nil nil 0 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" nil)
  ("To the Instructor" 0.14287 0.34596 0.40013 0.4344 0.4344 0.03426 0.00593 0.2776 0.0275 "ELLVYP+MyriadPro-SemiboldCond" 0.0286 t nil 0 "ELLVYP+MyriadPro-SemiboldCond" t)
  ("This book has been used successfully as a textbook for a very wide variety of data science" 0.14286 0.85714 0.44089 0.4623 0.4623 0.02141 0.00473 0.3488 0.0372 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" 0.0159 nil nil 0 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" nil)
