  ("learning and other technical disciplines. Part of the reason seemed to be that the focus" 0.14286 0.85776 0.57422 0.59563 0.59563 0.02141 0.00473 0.3114 0.0691 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" 0.0159 nil nil 0 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" nil)
