  ("2. Statistics books are usually careful to distinguish between a value and its estimate" 0.1534 0.85714 0.20574 0.22716 0.22716 0.02141 0.00473 0.3033 0.0147 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" 0.0159 nil nil 1 "ELLVYP+MinionPro-Regular" nil)
